    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.65,
      "end_seconds": 45.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.18,
      "end_seconds": 53.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Yeah, honestly, a couple of times a week. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.65,
      "end_seconds": 73.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "So, have you had any loss of bladder control?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.47,
      "end_seconds": 78.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any loss of bladder control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.02,
      "end_seconds": 86.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Any head injury or second seizure at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.33,
      "end_seconds": 90.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "no, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.55,
      "end_seconds": 94.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.87,
      "end_seconds": 98.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.89,
      "end_seconds": 102.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.45,
      "end_seconds": 108.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "No, you know, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.01,
      "end_seconds": 112.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.0,
      "end_seconds": 117.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.99,
      "end_seconds": 121.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.95,
      "end_seconds": 126.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.17,
      "end_seconds": 137.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.37,
      "end_seconds": 142.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "So, no, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.06,
      "end_seconds": 146.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.89,
      "end_seconds": 156.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.96,
      "end_seconds": 187.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 124 over 75, pulse is 85 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 97 percent. And temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.09,
      "end_seconds": 192.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.04,
      "end_seconds": 194.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.06,
      "end_seconds": 208.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "You are alert and your neurological examination is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.16,
      "end_seconds": 216.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.53,
      "end_seconds": 243.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards a breakthrough seizure after missed medication and poor sleep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.06,
      "end_seconds": 248.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.16,
      "end_seconds": 260.24,
      "duration_seconds": 11.08,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a breakthrough seizure after missed medication and poor sleep is my leading thought, not anything worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.2,
      "end_seconds": 275.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 277.71,
      "end_seconds": 280.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.97,
      "end_seconds": 299.26,
      "duration_seconds": 17.29,
      "text": "take your medicine at the same time every day and do not drive until we say so i'd like to see you again in four weeks right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.37,
      "end_seconds": 303.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.36,
